    "detailed_description": "Neera, the detective, is facing an unexpected conundrum.<br><br>She got an invitation to the mysterious witch forest. She eagerly accepted the magical invitation and hurried to the witch forest, her hastily packed luggage in tow.<br><br>She was duly allowed in, but when she reached her accommodation-to-be, what she found was an old, ruined house.<br><br>To add to her consternation, a powerful witch is crazily casting spells on anyone and everyone inside the forest, and an ancient artefact called the Time Orb has disappeared\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>\u272a Earn gold and upgrade the magic manor<br>\u272a Get into the Halloween mood!<br>\u272a Match 3 gameplay that is easy to play but hard to master<br>\u272a Pipe Joining, Slider, Jigsaw, and Solitaire minigames<br>\u272a 100 levels of fun match making<br>\u272a Gameplay options can be changed anytime",
